  "published": "2026-11-14T04:52:05.15Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0 Bundles apex-grid 5.0.0 (1.2.1 bundled 4.0.1). ShowHeader, ShowQuickFilter, ShowExport and ExportFilename parameters; PaginationConfiguration.Paginator (Full or Compact), and a Pagination change after the first render now reaches the grid; GridDataType.Chart with GridColumn.Chart, which draws with an ApexCharts 8.4.1 or later that the app loads itself (not bundled). The grid chrome is now sized in px, so it keeps its designed size on pages whose root font size is not 16px. The core bundle shares its apex-grid core and Lit with the new Blazor-ApexGrid-Enterprise package, so a page with community and enterprise grids holds one core. ApexGrid<TItem> opens a small seam for derived components: ExtendConfig, ElementId, IsInitialized and GetModuleAsync are protected, and the interop module's init takes an applyConfig function from a wrapping module. The ?ver= cache busters now carry the package version (1.3.0), since the vendored files changed without a core bump. Nothing a .NET caller uses is removed.",
